OL,5,G0000 First Responders
OL,6,     FA boatie jumps through a fireball
OL,7,     Fafter a gas explosion, a hunter
OL,8,     Fhas a heart attack, and fishermen
OL,9,     Fget some much-needed advice.
OL,10,G0100 Inside the Ambulance
OL,11,     FParamedics are sent to help a
OL,12,     Fwoman whose foot was run over by a
OL,13,     Fbin lorry, and a team is sent to
OL,14,     Fassess a man suffering from an
OL,15,     Fagonizing headache that has been
OL,16,     Fgoing on for days.
OL,17,G0135 Sort Your Life Out
OL,18,     FThe team help the Clark family
OL,19,     Fdeclutter, laying out their
OL,20,     Fbelongings in a warehouse only to
OL,21,     Ffind they own 521 odd socks, 75
OL,22,     FBarbies and 28 games controllers.
